# Implementation Plan - Unique MERN Capstone Projects Pool & Admin Dashboard

This plan details the architecture and step-by-step implementation for adding a pool of 30–32 unique Final Capstone Projects. The system will automatically allocate a unique project to each student upon request, restrict certificate generation until Capstone approval, and provide administrators with a dedicated control dashboard to audit allocations and submissions.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Allocation Limit**: Since there are exactly 32 unique projects in the pool, if the active student count exceeds 32, the automatic assignment logic will recycle projects using a least-congested allocation strategy (i.e. assigning the project that has the fewest active students).

